      "_gvid": 1,
      "name": "REQ_027",
      "label": "<FONT COLOR=\"#FFFFFF\"><B>Requirement</B><BR/><B>Audit Trail and Versioning</B><BR/><BR/>All Aurora cards SHALL include an audit_trail with a per-card SemVer version, an<BR/> optional SHA256 hash (nullable), and a chronological history of created/edited/<BR/>deleted events including editor identity and RFC3339 timestamps.<BR/></FONT>",
