      "name": "REQ_020",
      "label": "<FONT COLOR=\"#FFFFFF\"><B>Requirement</B><BR/><B>Boundary and Note Semantics</B><BR/><BR/>Boundary cards SHALL be used to group related cards for rendering and navigation<BR/>; they may have a subtype such as End to limit recursion. Note cards SHALL be us<BR/>ed only as annotative leaves (incoming links only) and SHALL NOT introduce new s<BR/>tructural model elements.<BR/></FONT>",
